  "body": "This development is unlike the rest - designed by renowned Allan Shanahan, with a choice between beautiful Scandinavian-inspired light timber and neutral tones or a richer, moodier combination of darker finishes. From the outset, quality has been paramount. Generous proportions, carefully considered layouts and an abundance of natural light define each home, with north-facing orientation maximising sunshine throughout the day. Interiors are elevated by premium material selections, including luxurious wool carpeting, substantial kitchen benchtops, beautifully appointed granite sinks and an extensive provision of cleverly integrated storage. Separate laundry rooms, dedicated entrance areas and beautifully considered everyday conveniences further reinforce the attention given to both form and function. Positioned just moments from the heart of Milford, set amongst some of the most prestigious real estate, the development combines an enviable central location with a level of specification and attention to detail that sets it apart.\r\n\r\nLot 1 offers approximately 179sqm of floor area across three levels, with three bedrooms, including a beautifully appointed master suite with walk-through wardrobe, a single internal-access garage and the added exclusivity of its own private pedestrian entrance directly from the street. Surrounded by garden space and with the road frontage, this unit is quite exclusive.  \r\n\r\nLots 2, 3 and 4 each offer approximately 122sqm of thoughtfully designed living, three bedrooms, a double internal-access garage and the convenience of a top-of-the-line lift access across all three levels. \r\n\r\nLot 5 is a particularly special offering. The largest of the collection, with approximately 206sqm of floor area and approximately 196sqm of land, this residence enjoys an expansive outdoor environment combining a generous deck with beautifully landscaped gardens. Its ground-floor living configuration opens through generous aluminum glazing and sliding doors, creating a wonderful connection between indoors and out. Complete with three bedrooms and exclusive off-street parking, it offers a distinctly different take on contemporary townhouse living.\r\n\r\nThe property, subject to the relevant enrollment schemes and criteria, is in zone for Milford Primary School, Takapuna Normal Intermediate, Westlake Boys High School, Westlake Girls High School and Takapuna Grammar School, while also being conveniently located near Rosmini College, Carmel College and St Joseph's Catholic School, Takapuna.\r\n\r\nFor viewings and more information contact Harry Richards 021 081 44513",
